  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Cardholders can earn 5% NeuCoins on non-EMI spends via Tata Neu and partner brands, along with 1.5% NeuCoins on other eligible spends and additional benefits through the Tata Neu ecosystem. The card also offers up to 8 domestic lounge visits per year, 4 international lounge visits annually. A welcome benefit of 1,499 NeuCoins is offered on the first transaction via the Tata Neu app. Overall, this card is suitable option for consumers who want to build or manage their credit history while availing everyday and travel benefits.",
    "highlights": [
      "5% NeuCoins on non-EMI spends made via Tata Neu and partner Tata brands such as Air India, Westside, and others",
      "Additional 5% NeuCoins on transactions through the Tata Neu app or website after downloading the app and registering for Tata NeuPass",
      "1.5% NeuCoins on non-Tata brand spends and all merchant EMI transactions"
    ],
    "welcome_benefit": "1,499 NeuCoins as welcome benefit on Tata neu App on the first transaction done within a month of card activation",
    "milestone_benefits": [
      "5% NeuCoins on non-EMI spends made via Tata Neu and partner Tata brands such as Air India, Westside, and others",
      "2 complimentary domestic lounge visits per quarter, on spending Rs. 50,000 in the previous quarter",
      "Annual fee will be waived off on spending Rs. 3 Lakh in a year",
      "1% fuel surcharge waiver, up to Rs. 500 in a month on a min. transaction value of Rs. 400 to Rs. 5,000 on all fuel stations across India"
    ],
